add('ClearAggro','003b8648','Requires pointer/userdata argument; AI_ClearAggro nonnull target removes pair from receiver threat map if found, removes receiver from target reciprocal map, notifies target AI virtual+60. If target current target==receiver, clears that target and issues target Cmd_Stop, even when threat entry absent. Null arg no-op; no zero-argument clear-all.', [('ClearAggro()','No threat mutation.'),('ClearAggro(null pointer)','No threat mutation.'),('ClearAggro(T), pair absent but T targets caller','T target cleared and T controller Stop issued.')], 'Selected AI threat services exist, but actor Lua dispatch/general reciprocal threat callback missing in CharacterScriptObjects (:144-146); clearing only caller threat/target omits reciprocal stop/event side effects.',refs=[(IDA+'003d/003d6d68.c',37)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'pointer tag2/userdata tag7','unit':'other Character identity','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b8648.c','line':21}]}],returns='No Lua value; pair threat erasure/AI notification/target stop conditional, no wrapper timer.')
add('AddAggro','003b8098','Requires >=2 args pointer/userdata Character and number float threat. AI_AddAggro accumulates old threat via AI_SetAggro. AI_SetAggro rejects caller IsPlayer, caller IsDead, or target IsDead; null target assertion domain. First pair notifies target AI virtual+56. Stores new threat in both caller map+124 and target reciprocal map+1116. Wrapper trace debug query only when returned threat delta>0; no Lua result.', [('caller IsPlayer; AddAggro(T,5)','No threat writes; setter returns0.'),('caller live NPC, target dead; AddAggro(T,5)','No threat writes.'),('live NPC pair threat3; AddAggro(T,2)','New pair threat5 stored in both maps; positive-delta trace query.')], 'Selected enemy threat tuning passes runtime values, but generic Lua receiver threat callback/reciprocal maps unavailable through CharacterScriptObjects (:144-146). Do not treat a one-sided numeric increment as original parity.',refs=[(IDA+'003d/003d7c68.c',14),(IDA+'003d/003d79ec.c',61)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'nonnull pointer/userdata','unit':'other Character identity','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b8098.c','line':23}]},{'index':2,'type':'number tag3 float','unit':'raw threat (not x256)','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b8098.c','line':38}]}],returns='No Lua result; conditional reciprocal threat maps/AI notification/debug query, no timer.')
add('ClearProps','003b82e4','Requires arg1; nonnull pointer tag2 resets provided property sheet then RecalcProperties(receiver,1). Booleantrue resets shared temporary sheet via PROPS_ResetSheet(null) without recalc. Pointer null, Booleanfalse, other type/missing no-op. ResetSheet null selects CharProperties::s_temp.', [('ClearProps(true)','Resets s_temp; no RecalcProperties call.'),('ClearProps(false)','No reset/recalc.'),('ClearProps(nonnull sheet P)','Resets sheet P then recalculates bound receiver.')], 'Selected skill/buff services own property sheets but general ClearProps Lua callback0x3b82e4 absent in CharacterScriptObjects (:144-146). Boolean temporary reset and supplied-sheet reset/recalc must remain distinct.',refs=[(IDA+'003d/003def84.c',3)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'pointer tag2 or Booleantrue','unit':'sheet identity or shared temp selector','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b82e4.c','line':23}]}],returns='No Lua result; sheet reset/recalc conditional, no timer/event.')
add('DoSkill','003b8bd8','Requires numeric tag3 skill index, unsigned < GetCharSkillList count. AI_UseSkill calls AI_BeginSkill; if begin success immediately calls AI_EndSkill. Begin rechecks active toggle-type1 (calls OnPreSkill directly), otherwise Usable: while using skill requires flag0x8000; casting or missing loaded script process rejects; script index must exist/nonnull and OnSkillCheck_Usable pass. Admitted begin stores active index, clears loop/end bytes, selects Skill FSM, counts player skill stat216 and trophy>199, then checks using-skill result. End only affects active type2 loop: stop loop if byte208 true, otherwise marks byte209.', [('skill count3; DoSkill(3)','No AI begin/end attempt.'),('valid skill, receiver casting; DoSkill(0)','Usable fails, no skill state/end transition.'),('valid type2 currently using, loop byte208false; source Begin succeeds through DoSkill','UseSkill invokes End and sets end-pending byte209true.')], 'Enemy and selected player skill owners trigger custom operation services; CharacterSkillNativeBindingsV5 list (:12) omits0x3b8bd8 and general CharacterScriptObjects dispatch (:144) lacks it. Original OnSkillCheck and FSM admission cannot be assumed from gameplay request alone.',refs=[(IDA+'003d/003d8868.c',5),(IDA+'003d/003d86bc.c',14),(IDA+'003d/003d8358.c',7),(IDA+'003d/003d8474.c',7)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'number tag3 -> unsigned index','unit':'receiver skill-list index','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b8bd8.c','line':19}]}],returns='No Lua value; admitted skill state/script/stat effects as described; script may start timers downstream.')
