add('SetSkillCooldownTimerId__','003b97e0','Requires >=2 args skill index and timer ID number/nil. Numeric first arg bypasses bounds guard; nonnumeric is converted/bounds-checked. Nonnull script at receiver skill slot gets script+24 unsigned timer ID; nil sets-1. Does not create or stop timer.', [('valid skill script0; SetSkillCooldownTimerId__(0,12)','Skill0 cooldown ID12.'),('valid script0; SetSkillCooldownTimerId__(0,nil)','Skill0 cooldown ID-1.'),('SetSkillCooldownTimerId__(0,true)','No assignment; second tag neither number nor nil.')], 'Original helper starts a timer separately, then stores ID; generic scene callback0x3b97e0 absent (:144-146). Port cooldown schedules do not prove arbitrary Lua handle setter.',port='MISSING',args=[{'index':1,'type':'skill index getNumber','unit':'receiver skill slot','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b97e0.c','line':22}]},{'index':2,'type':'number tag3/nil tag0','unit':'timer ID;-1 invalid','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b97e0.c','line':41}]}],returns='No Lua value; script cooldown field only; no timer/event.')
