add('Flee','003b91a0','Requires one admitted pointer/userdata arg but discards that userdata value. Uses receiver current target+1032; null current target no-op. Computes ownerTargetPosition+(ownerTargetPosition-currentTargetPosition) and calls Cmd_MoveTo(point), subject controller admission. It is one mirrored displacement, not normalized run speed/distance.', [('current target null; Flee(userdata T)','No motion command.'),('owner(10,0,0), current target(4,0,0), argument other O; Flee(O)','Cmd_MoveTo(16,0,0), based on current target not O.'),('Flee()','No command despite a current target.')], 'Monster flee policy has separate providers, but original generic0x3b91a0 missing in CharacterScriptObjects (:144-146). Do not infer argument-target use from Flee name.',port='MISSING',refs=[(IDA+'0040/004054e4.c',3)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'pointer tag2/userdata tag7 admitted but value ignored','unit':'none','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'003b/003b91a0.c','line':28}]}],returns='No Lua value; conditional mirrored destination controller command, no wrapper timer/event.')
