add('DealDamages','003906fc','Requires >=3 args; target userdata tag7 and valid numeric GameObjectDamager row arg2. Third arg required by arity but unused. Null target no-op. Character handle invokes F_GOAttack(row,flags0) then F_ApplyResult and pushes result.damage. GOAttack damage chooses inclusive integer[min,max]<<8; positive immunity class/duration consults defender class timer: active yields damage0, inactive starts duration timer; stores row damage event field+20. Result application online remote-attacker authority can return; otherwise applies debug god/no-damage, hit count/HP/reactions/scroll-text/sound and attacker/defender combat-result callbacks unless mask0x20000000. NonCharacter interaction type8 invokes virtual152(receiver) then pushes false; other object types no value.', [('DealDamages(T,row) only2args','No roll/application/return.'),('valid row,target null userdata,thirdanything; DealDamages(nil,row,0)','No roll or Lua result.'),('nonCharacter T interaction type8; DealDamages(T,row,0)','Invokes T interaction virtual152 with calling receiver; returns Booleanfalse, not damage integer.')], 'Selected trap/combat source services exist; generic scene0x3906fc callback absent (:144-146). Direct HP subtraction misses damager immunity timer, nonCharacter interaction branch and postcombat callback/sound/UI contract.',refs=[(IDA+'003b/003b061c.c',59),(IDA+'003b/003b10b4.c',50),(IDA+'003b/003b10b4.c',398)],args=[{'index':1,'type':'userdata tag7','unit':'target object','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'0039/003906fc.c','line':24}]},{'index':2,'type':'number tag3 valid unsigned GameObjectDamager index','unit':'damager row','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'0039/003906fc.c','line':29}]},{'index':3,'type':'required slot but not read','unit':'none','evidence':[{'source':IDA+'0039/003906fc.c','line':24}]}],returns='Character target result damage integer rawx256; attackable objectfalse; all failed gates no values. Combat timer/HP/events/UI/sound as above.')
